# UI

Read [`../../../.agents/skills/frontendStandard/SKILL.md`](../../../.agents/skills/frontendStandard/SKILL.md).

- Primitives from `@/components/ui/*` only
- Feature UI in `components/<feature>/<Name>.tsx` — PascalCase files
- Tailwind only via `cn()` on shadcn components
- No raw `<button>`, `<input>`, layout divs when shadcn or a block exists
- Server Components default; `"use client"` on smallest leaf
- No comments in source files
